{"id":"00365","root":"uni00365_1","name":{"ja":"ふうま　亜希","en":"Fuuma Aki"},"title":{"ja":"【祭り装束】","en":"【Festival Costume】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【祭り装束】 ふうま　亜希","en":"【Festival Costume】 Fuuma Aki"},"element":"Spiritual","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2020-08-14","limited":true,"characterId":187,"profile":{"ja":"傷口を引き裂く邪眼“死裂”を右目に持つ対魔忍。傷を負った状態で彼女の瞳を見ると強烈な暗示にかかり、小さな傷でもまるで臓物を切り裂かれた致命傷かのように感じてしまう。すると、現実の肉体も感覚に引きずられ、元の傷がほんのかすり傷でも、命を脅かすほどの傷へと変化する。その名の通りふうま宗家の分家出身。ただ一族の勢力争いなどには関わらず、弾正の反乱の折も中立の立場を取った。能力と血筋から、他の対魔忍達からは距離を置かれがちだが、本人は全く気にせずただ魔族を討つことのみを考えている。豊満な胸と鍛え上げられた肉体の持ち主で、やっかみ半分に「おっぱいゴリラ」などと言われる事も。彼女は陰口は気にしていないが、胸が大きいことで戦闘能力が落ちるのではないかとズレた心配をしていたりする。現在はヨミハラに拠点を置いて活動している。ヨミハラの一角で行われる夏祭りに参加して欲しいと言う依頼を受けた亜希。最初は気乗りしない様子だったが、子ども神輿の引率があると聞くとにわかに張り切り始め、法被にサラシ、褌という祭り装束に鉢巻きをキリリと締めて会場へと向う。","en":"(Fuuma Aki, she/her) A Taimanin bearing the cursed eye \"Death Rift\" in her right socket, which tears at any wound it sees. When someone looks into that eye while injured, they are overwhelmed by a vivid suggestion, feeling even a minor cut as if their innards were being sliced—a sensation that can turn a superficial wound into a life-threatening one. She hails from a branch family of the Fuuma clan, though she stayed neutral during the Danjo rebellion and avoids clan power struggles. Because of her ability and lineage, other Taimanin tend to keep their distance, but she cares little and focuses solely on slaying demons. Possessing a voluptuous bust and a honed physique, she is sometimes mockingly called a \"boob gorilla,\" a teasing she ignores while occasionally worrying whether her large chest hampers her combat effectiveness. Currently based in Yomihara, she received a request to join the town's summer festival. At first reluctant, she brightens at the prospect of leading a children's portable shrine, dons a happi, sarashi, fundoshi, and a tight headband, and heads to the venue."},"illustrator":"旭","voiceActor":"中野志乃","forms":[{"id":"uni00365_1"